verage, ion-pair arrangement or coordination geometry is assigned. Source: Main PDF p.4, Figure 4 and ligand-binding comparison","bromide":"Role: Figure 4 comparison constituent or ligand. Monatomic Br- surface-termination identity described by the article. This is distinct from the CTAB exchange reagent. No adsorption position, coverage, ion-pair arrangement or coordination geometry is assigned. Source: Main PDF p.4, Figure 4 and ligand-binding comparison"}},"sourceRecordSha256":{"liu2015-pbs-ligand-thermal-transport-acsnano5b05085-binding-group-comparison":"d4b21a9fa4f5b712ee03563c586427f3f26ab4bdd3c1586f110f84e53427d667"}},"solutionContexts":[]}
